WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
 What's up, Marvel fans?

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.100
We're here with Willem Dafoe,
who plays Green Goblin.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.900
All right.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.100
What was your
reaction when you were

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.380
told the premise of this film?

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.740
 It sounded good,
good enough to sign on,

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.470
you know, to revisit
this character.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.130
 Now what was it like
revisiting that character?

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:15.930
How was that?

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:16.730
 It was great.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:20.220
I mean, it's-- yeah,
it's a continuation.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.890
And this is probably
the most ambitious

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.290
film in the series so far.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.770
So it was great to be a part
of it, see some old friends,

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.430
see some new friends, you know.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.230
 That's incredible.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.630
What was it like working
with Director Jon

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:33.760
Watts and the awesome ensemble?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.560
 He was great.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.830
I mean, you know, they had--

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.960
a lot of the people had
worked together before.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.760
So they were really--
had good chemistry

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.890
already, had a lot of trust.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:48.540
And yeah, it was-- it was fun
to work, you know, very loose.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.020
But also, you know, we were--
we were making our days

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.280
and having fun.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.470
 Do you have a favorite
Spider-Man moment in the MCU?

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:57.270
 Oh, god.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.390
That-- that's a tough one.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.590
 Yeah, too hard.
I get it.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:00.390
There's so many.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:02.970
 Yeah, no, you know, I
enjoy doing the action stuff.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.020
[MUSIC PLAYING]

